                </div>
                <div>
                    <span>02</span>
                    <h3>Automate wisely.</h3>
                    <p>Connect services and remove repetitive work with practical automation.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <span>03</span>
                    <h3>Ship reliably.</h3>
                    <p>Deploy and operate applications with repeatable infrastructure.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

