                        </p>
                        <div class="mh-timeline-tags">
                            <span>LARAVEL</span>
                            <span>SAAS</span>
                            <span>AI INTEGRATION</span>
                            <span>MYSQL</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <span class="mh-timeline-status">01 / CURRENT</span>
                </article>

                <article class="mh-timeline-item">
                    <span class="mh-timeline-index">02</span>

                    <div class="mh-timeline-main">
                        <p class="mh-timeline-date">NOV 2023 — JUL 2024</p>
                        <h3>Full Stack Web Developer</h3>
                        <p class="mh-company">Xcode</p>
                        <p>
                            Built responsive React SPAs with Tailwind CSS,
