                    <span>START A CONVERSATION</span>
                    <span>↗</span>
                </a>

                <div class="mh-contact-links">
                    <a href="https://ai.arenabangla.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AI KNOWLEDGE HUB ↗</a>
                    <a href="https://arenabangla.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ARENABANGLA ↗</a>
